    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo. 29 Rivermill offers well-proportioned two-bedroom accommodation extending to approximately 67 sq. m. and is ideally located within the established Rivermill apartment development in Navan. The apartment is presented in good condition and provides a comfortable home in a secure, fully gated setting.\n\nRivermill is particularly well positioned for those seeking convenience, with Navan town centre just a short distance away and a host of everyday amenities including shopping, dining, schools, leisure facilities and public transport options close by. The property also benefits from excellent access to the M3 motorway, making commuting towards Dublin and other surrounding locations straightforward. Its combination of a convenient setting, secure development and manageable accommodation makes No. 29 Rivermill an appealing choice for a range of purchasers."
      },
